          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata eawoojisu ng'ay gwayeesha Bawlo Barnaba, “Beeni eebiikta mujiinajeega ghayi sirukwiideaysi ng'asheega Ng'utamiida, eadaaha fuga siduupcheewi gissin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa Barnaba gideaba gaygoodeayi sea Yohaneeda siguura Marko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwadaah Bawlo gideaba mwahida gideaba gaygoodeayi siida ghayi nung'usa heeda saawa aba ng'eanyiida Bamfiliya, ak ea meadeayi saawa gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwardu sheang'nyeeda haw aba dageascheeda nyaawa ea iidu gwaheeli; hean goodeayi Barnaba Marko ghwalach bugusta basooda ak gaweay ng'eanyiida Saypras, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata ghwaloat Bawlo Sila ak goodeayi, ak ghwanung' fuga siduupcheewi ghabeawa dagheerjeanduumeeda Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gwasik ng'eanyiida Shaamu ea Gilikiya nea goomajeek ganiisajeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
